{"ID":"20240506082126-oxcn9n8","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082126-oxcn9n8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082126-oxcn9n8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627103944-tl3ecy9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612134830-92pygsg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627104325-r3o3aby\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"241蛞蝓（鼻涕虫）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821165349"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627103944-tl3ecy9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627103944-tl3ecy9","updated":"20240627103944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 401px;","style":"width: 391px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛞蝓"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛞蝓-20240627103943-uyn3nd1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 391px;\" parent-style=\"width: 401px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627104214-1yqco9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627104214-1yqco9r","updated":"20240627104214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 558px;","style":"width: 548px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛞蝓4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛞蝓4-20240627104214-35lrez4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 548px;\" parent-style=\"width: 558px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 630px;","style":"width: 620px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛞蝓6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛞蝓6-20240627104509-vuzw9dr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 620px;\" parent-style=\"width: 630px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627104413-92p27ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627104413-92p27ee","updated":"20240821165235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 604px;","style":"width: 594px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛞蝓5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛞蝓5-20240627104414-qj56lp6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 594px;\" parent-style=\"width: 604px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 586px;","style":"width: 576px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛞蝓1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛞蝓1-20240627104029-ba8k7ix.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 576px;\" parent-style=\"width: 586px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627104325-r3o3aby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627104325-r3o3aby","updated":"20240821165349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 744px;","style":"width: 734px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛞蝓3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛞蝓3-20240627104325-5s94b36.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 734px;\" parent-style=\"width: 744px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 450px;","style":"width: 440px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛞蝓"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛞蝓-20240821165348-48vmeex.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 440px;\" parent-style=\"width: 450px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612134826-zywn1td","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612134826-zywn1td"}},{"ID":"20240612135000-p4ez4o1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135000-p4ez4o1","updated":"20240612135004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135000-0f168ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135000-0f168ja","updated":"20240612135000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135000-1q0xqqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135000-1q0xqqy","updated":"20240612135000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主贼风，僻，轶筋，及脱肛，惊痫挛缩。一名陵蠡。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135000-anq4nfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135000-anq4nfo","updated":"20240612135000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名土蜗，一名附蜗，生大山及阴地沙石垣下，八月取。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135000-vs5ju8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135000-vs5ju8z","updated":"20240612135000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蝓，虎蝓也，蠃，一石虎蝓。《广雅》云：蠡蠃、蜗牛，螔蝓也。《中山经》云：青要之山是多仆累。郭璞云：仆累，蜗牛也，《周礼》鳖人，祭祀供蠃。郑云：蠃螔蝓。《尔雅》云：蚹蠃螔蝓。郭璞云：即蜗牛也。《名医》曰：别出蜗牛条，非。旧作蛞，《说文》所无。据玉篇云：蛞蛞东，知即活东异文，然则当为活。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135112-ez9zqz7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135112-ez9zqz7"}},{"ID":"20240612135133-zrgcay1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135133-zrgcay1","updated":"20240612135133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135133-m9tk8e9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135133-m9tk8e9","updated":"20240612135133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即蜒蚰螺"}]},{"ID":"20240612135133-x56lwff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135133-x56lwff","updated":"20240612135133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏盐。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135133-hduyp7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135133-hduyp7i","updated":"20240612135133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸，寒。主治贼风、 僻、轶筋，及脱肛、惊痫、挛缩，消痰核。得京墨研，涂痔疮肿痛。生捣，涂蜈蚣咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135137-s5nmgo0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135137-s5nmgo0"}},{"ID":"20240612135113-5u12u3a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135113-5u12u3a","updated":"20240612135118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135113-piel04g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135113-piel04g","updated":"20240612135113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，无毒。主治贼风 僻，轶筋及脱肛，惊痫，挛缩。一名陵蠡，一名土蜗，一名附蜗。生太山池泽及阴地沙石垣下。八月取。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135113-uix6bcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135113-uix6bcw","updated":"20240612135113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓无壳，不应有蜗名，其附蜗者，复名蜗牛。生池泽沙石，则应是今山蜗。或当言其头，形类犹似蜗牛虫者，世名蜗牛者，作瓜字，则蜗字亦音瓜。庄子所云，战于蜗角也。蛞蝓入三十六禽限，又是四种角虫之类。荧室星之精矣。方家殆无复用乎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134932-y0cj7v1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612134932-y0cj7v1"}},{"ID":"20240612134952-jcmusqt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612134952-jcmusqt","updated":"20240612134955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134952-uiua4k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134952-uiua4k6","updated":"20240612134952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．一名土蜗，一名附蜗．生太山及阴地沙石垣下．八月取．"}]},{"ID":"20240612134952-nngtknb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134952-nngtknb","updated":"20240612134952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶蛞蝓，味咸，寒．主贼风 僻，轶筋及脱肛，惊痫挛缩．一名陵蠡．生池泽．"}]},{"ID":"20240612134933-8dyk0b9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612134933-8dyk0b9"}},{"ID":"20240612134943-o76z2l0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612134943-o76z2l0","updated":"20240612134947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134943-hbbkmg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134943-hbbkmg0","updated":"20240612134943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，无毒。主贼风 贼，轶筋，及脱肛，惊痫挛缩。一名陵蠡，一名土蜗，一名附蜗。生太山池泽，及阴地沙石垣下，八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134933-b0ejvwh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612134933-b0ejvwh"}},{"ID":"20240612134934-qua81dj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612134934-qua81dj","updated":"20240612134937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134934-fdw9p9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134934-fdw9p9n","updated":"20240612134934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。主贼风僻。轶筋及脱肛。惊痫挛缩。一名陵蠡。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134934-tqyh0ec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134934-tqyh0ec","updated":"20240612134934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜗螺寄壳。名假形殊。屈伸双角。单躯。迹留涎滑。胎托腥污。毒虫局促。脑肤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134934-21tipnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134934-21tipnd","updated":"20240612134934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说文。附裸背负壳者为蜗牛。无壳者曰蛞蝓。寇宗曰。蜗牛四角。蛞蝓二角。身肉只一段。毒虫行所过之路。触其涎即死。博雅。。垢浊也。宋书传。王僧达单躯弱嗣。李时珍曰。俗名托胎虫。铁围山丛谈。峤南多蜈蚣。见托胎虫即局促不行。虫乃登其首。陷其脑。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134934-amotz0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134934-amotz0u","updated":"20240612134934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王孝籍书。毒螫肤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134826-lbn9lb8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612134826-lbn9lb8"}},{"ID":"20240612134907-bnpkx8g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612134907-bnpkx8g","updated":"20240612134915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134907-ndestz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134907-ndestz4","updated":"20240612134907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，无毒。主贼风 僻，轶筋及脱肛，惊痫挛缩。一名陵蠡，一名土蜗，一名附蜗。生太山池泽及阴地沙石垣下。八月取。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134907-nxug1om","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134907-nxug1om","updated":"20240612134907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓无壳，不应有蜗名，其附蜗者，复名蜗牛。生池泽沙石，则应是今山蜗，或当言其头，形类犹似蜗牛虫者，俗名蜗牛者，作瓜字，则蜗字亦音瓜。庄子所云，战于蜗角也。蛞蝓入三十六禽限，又是四种角虫之类。荧室星之精矣，方家殆无复用乎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134907-98wmmto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134907-98wmmto","updated":"20240612134907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕三十六禽。亥而射人，其肚合屎干烧为灰，主黄胆，猪之类也。陶谓为蝓，误极大矣。又《山海经》云∶KT 彘身人面，音如婴儿，食人兽。《尔雅》云∶ KT类，迅走食人，并非蛞蝓也。蛞蝓乃无壳蜗蠡也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134921-s0zl594","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612134921-s0zl594"}},{"ID":"20240612134922-1mbwdke","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612134922-1mbwdke","updated":"20240612134926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134922-afu85wx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134922-afu85wx","updated":"20240612134922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味咸寒，无毒。主治贼风 僻，跌筋，及脱肛，惊痫，孪缩。（蛞蝓音阔俞。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612134922-5naloku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134922-5naloku","updated":"20240612134922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蛞蝓即蜒蚰也，大者如人手指，肥泽有涎，头有二角，行则角出，惊之则缩，以其身涎涂止。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612134922-k73tvaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134922-k73tvaz","updated":"20240612134922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜒蚰感雨湿之气而生，故气味咸寒。主定惊清热，解毒输筋。寇宗 曰∶蛞蝓能解蜈蚣毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134922-hppx3p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134922-hppx3p2","updated":"20240612134922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近时治咽喉肿痛，风热喉痹，用簪脚捡之，内入喉中，令吞下，即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134827-q7l8r28","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612134827-q7l8r28"}},{"ID":"20240612134836-sr4x61l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612134836-sr4x61l","updated":"20240612134903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛞蝓《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134836-5cjwbzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134836-5cjwbzk","updated":"20240612134836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。无毒。主贼风 僻，惊痫挛缩。生研水服止渴，烧灰猪脂调敷脱肛，和蛤粉敷发背，石灰淹治牙虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134827-djy4qlf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612134827-djy4qlf"}},{"ID":"20240612134828-fc88kor","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-fc88kor","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：蛞蝓"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-nbm0qor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-nbm0qor","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-luim5je","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-luim5je","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Kuò Yú"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-6b876gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-6b876gr","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-iqvom24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-iqvom24","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鼻涕虫、大蛞蝓、黄蛞蝓、野蛞蝓、双线粘液蛞蝓"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-bpaupq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-bpaupq4","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-zy1i7ni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-zy1i7ni","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 软体动物门腹足纲蛞蝓科"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大蛞蝓"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Limax maximus L.；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄蛞蝓"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"L. flavus L.；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"野蛞蝓"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Agriolimax agrestis L.；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"双线粘液蛞蝓"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Phiolomycus bilineatus （Benson）。以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-yuksyvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-yuksyvx","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-80keil0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-80keil0","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-44ac9h7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-44ac9h7","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-vz48o87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-vz48o87","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 疏风，镇静，固脱，解毒。主治热疮肿毒，支气管喘息，痔疮肿毒，脱肛等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-fc3jqlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-fc3jqlb","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-ix5ykux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-ix5ykux","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"支气管喘息"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：鲜蛞蝓10条、贝母3钱，共捣，每服5分，日服2次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-95m6l1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-95m6l1o","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脚腿烂疮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：蛞蝓焙干研面，香油调擦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-odyri4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-odyri4l","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-6nibi58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-6nibi58","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-zu817lm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-zu817lm","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蛞蝓"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-pip184l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-pip184l","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-etgx57m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-etgx57m","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Kuò Yú"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-t1so3rq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-t1so3rq","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-1z1mjxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-1z1mjxi","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 陵蠡（《本经》），土蜗、附蜗（《别录》），蜒蚰（《救急方》），托胎虫（《铁围山丛谈》），蛞蜗（《品汇精要》），鼻涕虫（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-l7lgj0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-l7lgj0l","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-tcs9c0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-tcs9c0a","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-ne3mef4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-ne3mef4","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-y68ahni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-y68ahni","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蛞蝓科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蛞蝓"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏季捕捉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-azstpzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-azstpzk","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-5ossdly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-5ossdly","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 雌雄同体。体长圆形，长约4.5厘米，背面淡褐色或黑色，腹面白色。头部前端有触角2对，后方的一对较长，其顶端各有眼1个。触角能自由伸缩，如遇刺激，则立即缩入；其右侧附近有生殖孔的开口。头端腹侧有口。体前方的右侧，有一呼吸孔。跖面有粘液腺，分泌粘液，匍行经过处，常留有白色粘液的痕迹。感觉灵敏，触之立即蜷缩。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-p8zg4qy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-p8zg4qy","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栖于阴湿处，多见于潮湿的墙脚及树枝间，匍行时，常舐食植物茎叶的表皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-goq3z6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-goq3z6m","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-85xoshr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-85xoshr","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草再新》：\"入肝、脾、肺三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-abz3xu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-abz3xu1","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-cgtvhlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-cgtvhlo","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本经》：\"味咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-1d5f3gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-1d5f3gm","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》： \"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-fn0pfi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-fn0pfi9","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-cuwegdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-cuwegdr","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"非真有风热者不宜用，小儿薄弱多泄者不宜用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-rx5pnoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-rx5pnoe","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《得配本草》：\"畏盐。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-6j5duvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-6j5duvm","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-jdrrbbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-jdrrbbf","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热祛风，消肿解毒，破痰通经。治中风歪僻，筋脉拘挛，惊痫，喘息，喉痹，咽肿，痈肿，丹毒，经闭，症瘕，蜈蚣咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-x3kxc2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-x3kxc2w","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主贼风歪僻，轶筋及脱肛，惊痫挛缩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-s5ofrno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-s5ofrno","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草衍义》：\"治蜈蚣、蝎毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-su48mp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-su48mp1","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"治肿毒焮热，热疮肿痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-x642jjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-x642jjl","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草汇言》：\"善治一切风热火燥为眚，一切风热火痰为病。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-5akm9ra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-5akm9ra","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草崇原》：\"主定惊清热，解毒输（舒）筋。治咽喉肿痛，风热喉痹，纳入喉中，令吞下。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-6c6ajo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-6c6ajo9","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《得配本草》：\"消痰核。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-u1xmjl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-u1xmjl2","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《泉州本草》：\"通经破瘀，解毒消肿，利小便。主治月经闭止，癥瘕腹痛，损伤瘀血作痛，痈肿丹毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-ewgzkvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-ewgzkvl","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《吉林中草药》：\"疏风，镇惊，固脱。治热疮肿痛，支气管炎，脱肛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-m4zawqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-m4zawqi","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-jw92gf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-jw92gf6","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：焙干研末或研烂作丸。外用：研末或捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-dbfekhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-dbfekhw","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-i8hykmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-i8hykmz","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治阳火躁扰，阴血亏竭，贼风乘虚入中经络，至成口歪身僻，四肢挛缩者：用五加皮六两，当归身四两。共酒炒，研细末，蜓蚰百枚，研烂为丸。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-5gm7x7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-5gm7x7z","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治一切痰火风喉症：青脆梅子百枚，活蜒蚰一、二百条，同放瓦罐中。每日将梅取出，晒后仍入罐中，明日再晒，以收干汁为度，再用微火烘干，用则以一个噙化，或炙脆研末，加入诸药内。（《种福堂公选良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-31gdgh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-31gdgh5","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治喘息：蛞蝓一百条。洗净，加贝母适量，同捣如泥，为丸，每次五分，日服二次。（《吉林中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-a523ggi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-a523ggi","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治闭经瘀血作痛：蛞蝓（醋炙）为末，泡酒服，每次一钱。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-w5c51e1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-w5c51e1","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治痔热肿瘤者：蛞蝓、京墨研涂妙。（《妇人良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-a0is2yw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-a0is2yw","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治丹毒痈肿：活蛞蝓数只。醋浸捣烂，入冰片少许敷患处。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-ecl3260","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-ecl3260","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治脚胫烂疮，臭秽不可近：蜒蚰十条。瓦焙研末，油调敷之。（《救急方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-ttk6cnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-ttk6cnr","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-veufcuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-veufcuz","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》：\"蛞蝓，味咸，气寒、无毒。《经》曰：清静则肉腠闭拒，虽大风苛毒，弗能害也。如阴血亏竭，阳气躁扰，则腠理不密，贼风乘虚而入。风主摇动，中于经络，故歪僻、挛缩、轶筋、筋急所自来矣。又风为阳邪，筋脉得之皆燥急，咸寒能益阴润燥软坚，则筋脉舒缓，经络通达而诸证除矣。惊痫者风热也，脱肛者大肠热也，腕跌者血脉伤必发热也，咸寒总除诸热，所以主之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-nt8u1ad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-nt8u1ad","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-jyo0lw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-jyo0lw9","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-j7qcqg0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-j7qcqg0","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蛞蝓"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-48funod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-48funod","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-jykkzqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-jykkzqp","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Kuò Yú"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-rbo4fyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-rbo4fyl","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-y4zklea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-y4zklea","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 陵蠡、土蜗、附蜗、蜒蚰、托胎虫、蛞蜗、鼻涕虫、蜒蚰螺"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-xje5dpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-xje5dpb","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-1x33hlk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-1x33hlk","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Limax， Slug"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-7vcg741","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-7vcg741","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-54zqdf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-54zqdf5","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-9dlvvi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-9dlvvi0","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-ovqzhbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-ovqzhbq","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蛞蝓科动物黄蛞蝓、野蛞蝓的全体。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-gwptgxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-gwptgxx","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Limax frauus(Linnaeus)2.Agriolimax agrestis(Linnaeus)"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-mllq35v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-mllq35v","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏季于潮湿阴暗处捕捉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-6hlrsug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-6hlrsug","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-jqk1kz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-jqk1kz2","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生活于阴暗潮湿、腐殖质多的地方。畏光怕热，白天匿藏，夜晚及阴雨天活动，杂食性，喜食蔬菜、瓜果、植物叶及幼苗等，也食人们食物的残渣。为农业害虫。分布于黑龙江、吉林、新疆、江苏、浙江、河南、湖南、广东、广西、四川、云南及北京、上海等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-7mmagi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-7mmagi0","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生活习性同上种。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-wy6bzgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-wy6bzgj","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于黑龙江、吉林、新疆、江苏、浙江、河南、湖南、广东、广西、四川、云南及北京、上海等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-a80vg6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-a80vg6z","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于内蒙古、河北、新疆、江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、河南、湖北、湖南、广东、海南、广西、贵州、去南、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-i8y0u3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-i8y0u3n","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-7fq8qi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-7fq8qi1","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.黄蛞蝓，无外壳，体柔软，呈不规则的圆柱形，体前端宽大，后端狭小，尾部具有短的尾嵴。在活动时，最大者体长可达120mm，体宽12mm。头部具有2对浅蓝色的触角，大触角顶端具眼点。在身体背部前端的1/3处，有一椭圆形的外套膜，其前半部呈游离状态。背面具有同心圆的皱褶。体呈黄褐色或深橙色，具有分散淡黄色的斑点，靠近足部两侧的颜色较浅，跖足为淡黄色。贝壳退化为内壳，包在外套膜内，为一薄而透明、椭圆形的石灰质板。背部具有明显的生长纹。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-brwf752","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-brwf752","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.野蛞蝓，无外壳，体柔软光滑，呈不规则的圆柱形，尾部狭长，具有钝的尾嵴。活运输早展时，体长30-60mm，宽4-6mm，内壳壳长4mm，宽2mm。体表呈灰色、黄褐色或暗褐色，有的个体有浅的和不明显的暗带纹或斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-0jotdvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-0jotdvz","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-yl5hb3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-yl5hb3h","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全体含一种特殊的凝集素（specific lectin）：唾液酸（sialic acid）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-0bezc3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-0bezc3d","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-sqo40dn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-sqo40dn","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蛞蝓混悬液以800mg/kg剂量给荷瘤小鼠灌胃，24h后对ARS肉瘤（腹水型）即表现为明显的抑制作用。抑制率达47.4%；而给药剂量为120mg/kg时，48h抑瘤率可达51.6%。对Lewis肺癌抑制率则蛞蝓混悬液以800mg/kg剂量给药，24h为最佳，抑瘤率为30%以上。离体实验表明，其0.6%蛞蝓浸出液明显抑制肺癌细胞（A549）生长。而蛞蝓混悬液600-1200mg/kg剂量给小鼠灌药7天，对P388淋巴细胞性白血病具有明显的抑制作用。其中900mg/kg剂量效果最好。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-7e4sp9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-7e4sp9i","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-0pqu1lp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-0pqu1lp","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝；肺；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-cq6shbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-cq6shbe","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-byxt1ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-byxt1ez","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-e9yh1k0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-e9yh1k0","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-hzsjxql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-hzsjxql","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：非真有风热者不宜用，小儿薄弱多泄者不宜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-w0ubaix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-w0ubaix","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《得配本草》：畏盐。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-x6smw45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-x6smw45","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-hov6amg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-hov6amg","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风定惊；清热解毒；消肿止痛。主中风僻；筋脉拘挛；惊痫；喘息；咽肿；喉痹；痈肿；丹毒；痰核；痔疮肿痛；脱肛"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-4ba4p57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-4ba4p57","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-jysy2x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-jysy2x2","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：焙干研末或研烂为丸，2-3条。外用：研末或捣敷，5-10条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-vx939w5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-vx939w5","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-ys3szfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-ys3szfv","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治阳火躁扰，阴血亏竭，贼风乘虚人中经络，至成口歪身僻，四肢挛缩者： 用五加皮六两，当归身四两。共酒炒，研细末，蜒蚰百枚，研烂为丸。(《方脉正宗》)②治一切痰火风喉症： 青脆梅子百枚， 活蜒蚰一、二百条，同放瓦罐中，每日将梅取出，晒后仍入罐中，明日再晒，以收干汁为度，再用微火烘干，用则以一个噙化，或炙脆研末，加入诸药内。 (《种福堂公选良方》)③治喘息： 蛞蝓一百条。洗净，加贝母适量，同捣如泥，为丸，每次五分，日服二次。 (《吉林中草药》)④治闭经瘀血作痛： 蛞蝓(醋炙)为末，泡酒服，每次一钱。 (《泉州本草》)⑤治痔热肿痛者： 蛞蝓、京墨研涂妙。(《妇人良方》)⑥治丹毒痈肿： 活蛞蝓数只。醋浸捣烂，入冰片少许敷患处。(《泉州本草》)⑦治脚腔烂疮，臭秽不可近： 蜒蚰十条。瓦焙研末，油调敷之。 (《救急方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-dn5c24c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-dn5c24c","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-vvhxevv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-vvhxevv","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：蛞蝓，味咸、气寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-h5q2h2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-h5q2h2g","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《经》曰：清静则肉腠闭拒，虽大风苛毒，弗能害也。如阴血亏竭，阳气躁扰，则腠理不密，贼风乘虚而入。风主摇动，中于经络，故歪僻、挛缩、轶筋、筋急所自来矣。又风为阳邢，筋脉得之皆燥急，咸寒能益阴润燥软坚，则筋脉舒缓，经络通达而诸证除矣。惊痫者风热也，脱肛者大肠热也，WAN跌者血脉伤必发热也，咸寒总除诸热，所以主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-7wsvqn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-7wsvqn3","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》：主贼风WO僻，轶筋及脱肛，惊痫挛缩。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-0cx0eo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-0cx0eo6","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草衍义》：治蜈蚣、蝎毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-wbxwdty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-wbxwdty","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《纲目》：治肿毒热，热疮肿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-cbsz5tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-cbsz5tv","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草汇言》：善治一切风热火燥为眚，一切风热火痰为病。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-oleha5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-oleha5r","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草崇原》：主定惊清热，解毒输(舒)筋。治咽喉肿痛，风热喉痹，纳入喉中，令吞下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-qqle4b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-qqle4b6","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《得配本草》：消痰核。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-dgptmqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-dgptmqi","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《泉州本草》：通经破瘀，解毒消肿，利小便。主治月经闭止，症瘕腹痛，损伤瘀血作痛，痈肿丹毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-10am62j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-10am62j","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《吉林中草药》：疏风，镇惊，固脱。治热疮肿痛，支气管炎，脱肛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-7bs5h4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-7bs5h4v","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612134828-9otfqmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134828-9otfqmt","updated":"20240612134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612134829-w4epfrj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612134829-w4epfrj"}},{"ID":"20240612134830-92pygsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612134830-92pygsg"}}]}